OL,3,GNEWSAOxford St pedestrianisation: What
OL,4,Ayou need to know
OL,5,
OL,6,FCars, buses, taxis and bicycles are set
OL,7,Fto disappear from much of Oxford Street
OL,8,Flater this month, as part of a scheme
OL,9,Fto pedestrianise almost a kilometre of
OL,10,Fthe road.
OL,12,FThe major overhaul of the popular
OL,13,Fshopping destination will begin this
OL,14,Fautumn, with the first phase of the
OL,15,Fscheme expected to be finished by
OL,16,Fspring 2027.
OL,18,FHere's everything we know about the
OL,19,Fplans so far.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,326,320,200,140,0,100
